<title>GERMANY: German IFO business climate index jumps in October.</title>
<headline>German IFO business climate index jumps in October.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The German IFO economics institute gave the following data from its October business climate survey:</p>
<p>    West Germany		     Oct 1996	 Sept 1996</p>
<p>     Business climate		  97.4		 95.7</p>
<p>     Business conditions	     91.7		 90.4</p>
<p>     Business expectations	  103.1		101.1</p>
<p>    East Germany		     Oct 1996	 Sept 1996</p>
<p>     Business climate		  102.4		103.9</p>
<p>     Business conditions	     121.1		121.8</p>
<p>     Business expectations	   86.5		 88.3</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
